jobs.description:
Join our team at a company that produces high-quality bows, arrows, and shields!

Location: Nieuwkuijk, Netherlands

Position: Production Worker (Packing Department)

Shift: Day shift

Requirements for this job:

- Language: Dutch or English

- Accommodation: Own accommodation What will you do?

What will you do:

- The first tasks you will start with are packing rolls of paper and nets.

- Once you do this well and show that you want to learn more, there is potential to expand into logistics tasks;

- This could include unloading goods, unpacking, registering, and repacking;

- Collecting orders using a handheld scanner or the automated system;

- Packing packages and preparing them for shipment. Who are you?

- You are enthusiastic, flexible, and enjoy taking responsibility;

- You have (some) experience in logistics – or you are eager to learn;

- You speak English or Dutch, this is to ensure safety in the warehouse.

What we offer:
• A varied job in a growing, international company;
• Competitive salary and good employment benefits;
• The possibility of a permanent contract with good performance;
• A healthy work/life balance – you only work during the day, from Monday to Friday;
• 25 vacation days per year (based on full-time) with the option to buy 2 extra weeks;
• Travel allowance, 8% holiday pay, and pension scheme;
• Plenty of opportunities to learn, develop yourself, and grow along with the company;
• Fun drinks, team outings, and activities organized by our own activities committee!

Contact us if you are interested in this job:

work@matchsupportbv.nl or

As an Order Picker, you help make sure customers receive their orders quickly and correctly.

Your tasks include:

- Picking orders using a handheld scanner;
- Checking products and quantities;
- Packing and preparing orders for shipment;
- Placing products in the correct warehouse locations;
- Loading and unloading trucks;
- Helping colleagues when needed;
- Keeping the warehouse clean and safe.

Working Hours

You will work 40 hours per week.

You can choose between:

Morning Shift

- 07:00 AM to 04:00 PM

Evening Shift

- 04:00 PM to 01:00 AM

- MBO level or similar working and thinking level;
- Motivated and willing to work hard;
- Accurate and reliable;
- Able to speak Dutch or English;
- Physically fit and comfortable with warehouse work;
- Own transportation (car, scooter, moped, or e-bike);
- Warehouse experience is a plus, but not required.

Are you a solid Production Worker with an eye for detail? Then this Garden Furniture Production job is your new job!
Acerca de la empresaFor over seventy years, Keter has been inspiring people around the world with great, innovative high-end products for in home and gardens. The products are sold in 100 different countries, multiple design awards and product of the year awards are won by this company. To keep this quality high they are looking for a Production employee.
 Working hours as a Production Worker 3 shifts are: 6:50-15:00, 14:50-23:00 en 22:50-7:00.
Sobre el trabajoIn this full-time job, you will be reponsible for all production work around the injection molding machine. You will pack products and prepare them for departure. You will also keep an eye on the inventory of the machines. Thanks to you, the production process runs smoothly!
  - You understand and speak/write English;
 - You have a hands-on mentality;
 - You are reliable;
 - You find it no problem to perform multiple tasks.

Requisitos - Some experience in a factory environment is a plus;
 - Preferably English or Dutch speaking;
 - Flexibility for shift work.
 - EU nationality.

Qué ofrecemos - €14,99 + 20% shift bonus becomes €17,99;
 - Full-time job;
 - Flexible working hours;
 - Good working conditions;
 - Travel allowances.

We’re looking for a reach truck operator who is skilled at driving this type of equipment for a dynamic organization in the Echt region. In this role, you’ll be responsible for handling incoming and outgoing goods using a reach truck. Does working in a clean, well-organized facility energize you? This permanent position offers you job security on the day shift!

Duties:

- Placing pallets of products on shelves using a single-deep or double-deep reach truck;
- Picking orders; 
- Assisting with loading containers; 
- Supporting all logistical tasks as they arise.

You’ll spend most of your time operating the reach truck, so it’s important that you have experience with this type of logistics vehicle. Do you see yourself in this role? Don’t hesitate—read on!

This is a day shift position from 6:00 AM to 3:00 PM, Monday through Friday. 

- Experience operating a reach truck and a certificate demonstrating that you possess the qualities of a good reach truck operator;
- You speak Dutch, English, or German.
